  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Balkan Business Women mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the development of female entrepreneurs in North Macedonia, Albania and Kosovo. The project should support the growth of the participant&apos;s existing businesses and smaller upcoming entrepreneurs. The project additionally seeks to improve collaboration and coordination among the regional offices of The Netherlands in North Macedonia, Albania, and Kosovo to generate a favourable influence on the business climate in the host nations.</narrative>
  </description>
